素（按重要性降序描述）：\n1.  **主要主体**：人物、动物、主要物体（他们在哪？在做什么？）。\n2.  **场景与环境**：地理位置（如田野、村庄）、建筑、室内陈设、自然景物。\n3.  **细节与物件**：服装款式、家具、工具、交通工具、植物等具有时代或地域特征的物品。\n4.  **视觉构成**：视角（平视、俯视）、构图（特写、全景）、显著的光影效果（如逆光、阴影）。\n\n# 输出格式要求：\n- 使用中文，以逗号分隔的短语或短句列表形式输出。\n- 避免使用完整的长句，更不要写成段落。\n- 示例正确输出：“一个中年男性，穿着白色背心和蓝色工装裤，在稻田里弯腰插秧，远处有砖瓦房，天空中有云，上午的阳光。”\n\n# 禁止使用的词汇类型（绝对不要出现）：\n- **时代与风格词**：例如“80年代”、“复古”、“怀旧”、“老式”、“具有年代感”。\n- **主观评价词**：例如“温馨的”、“破旧的”、“美丽的”、“质朴的”。\n- **质量与状态词**：例如“泛黄的”、“模糊的”、“胶片质感”、“黑白照片”（除非图片本身就是黑白影像）。\n- **抽象概念**：例如“乡村回忆”、“历史气息”、“生活气息”。", "", "one by one", 24, 1024, 831287780579340, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 90, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 91, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "link": 127, "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "system_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "system_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "inference_mode"}, "name": "inference_mode", "label": "inference_mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "inference_mode"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_frames"}, "name": "max_frames", "label": "max_frames", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_frames"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_size"}, "name": "max_size", "label": "max_size", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_size"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, 